WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.981
How many orders came in on WhatsApp today?

2
00:00:02.981 --> 00:00:05.807
And how many did someone retype, line by line?

3
00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:06.852
Meet Tazmin.

4
00:00:06.852 --> 00:00:11.044
The order assistant for equipment distributors, right inside WhatsApp.

5
00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:19.129
Your rep forwards the message, and Tazmin identifies the customer, pulls their price list, and matches every line to an exact SKU.

6
00:00:19.129 --> 00:00:20.980
Within a minute, a clean quote.

7
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.564
Something unclear?

8
00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.039
Tazmin doesn't guess.

9
00:00:24.039 --> 00:00:26.498
Three options, and the rep decides.

10
00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:30.595
The rep approves with one tap, and the customer gets a clean quote.

11
00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:33.496
Send us real orders from this week.

12
00:00:33.496 --> 00:00:34.008
Tazmin.

13
00:00:34.008 --> 00:00:35.180
Orders in order.

14
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.131
Reps at ease.
